00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:21.140
SpaceX has brought turbine blade production in-house using new manufacturing methods. The approach reduces reliance on external suppliers for critical raptor engine components.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:32.460
Internal casting and finishing processes allow faster iteration on blade geometry and materials. The change supports higher engine production rates needed for starship flight cadence.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:45.380
Metalurgical teams are now controlling every step from alloy melt to final coating application. This vertical integration also enables real-time adjustments to cooling whole patterns based on hot fire results.

